{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32117","headline":"莲浦谣 · 温庭筠","name":"莲浦谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸣桡轧轧溪溶溶，废绿平烟吴苑东。\n水清莲媚两相向，镜里见愁愁更红。\n白马金鞭大堤上，西江日夕多风浪。\n荷心有露似骊珠，不是真圆亦摇荡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32117.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32117","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}